## 🔌 Bridge 源码 / Bridge Source

`src/HsAuto.Bridge/` 已包含 HearthLeap Bridge 的完整 C# 源码，包括管道宿主、协议处理、游戏适配和身份读取组件。Bridge 项目不会把 BepInEx、Unity 或游戏程序集提交到仓库；这些引用由构建脚本从用户自己的炉石安装目录读取。

`tools/Build-UserVersion.ps1` 可在 Windows PowerShell 7 中自动检查本机路径、构建 GUI、构建 Bridge 并运行离线自检：

```powershell
.\tools\Build-UserVersion.ps1 -GameRoot "D:\Games\Hearthstone"
```

`GameRoot` 必须指向包含 `Hearthstone.exe` 的目录。脚本只读取编译引用，不复制游戏 DLL，也不会把游戏程序集写入 GitHub 发布包。

The complete C# Bridge source is included under `src/HsAuto.Bridge/`, including the pipe host, protocol handling, game adapter, and identity readers. BepInEx, Unity, and game assemblies are not committed; the build reads them from the user’s own Hearthstone installation.

On Windows PowerShell 7, run:

```powershell
.\tools\Build-UserVersion.ps1 -GameRoot "D:\Games\Hearthstone"
```

The script checks local paths, builds the GUI and Bridge, and runs offline self-tests. It reads local compile-time references only and does not copy game DLLs into the public source package.
